    "created_at": "2023-07-19T17:19:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-19T17:19:17Z",
    "body": "No *output* change, yes, but I indeed still have the hole in my testing that I don't have visibility into the message output. It's on my plate this quarter to fix.\r\n\r\nThat said, I'm surprised this failed. But looking at the HTML parser, indeed [this is a parse error](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#attribute-value-(unquoted)-state). The other characters in that parse error make sense but I think complaining about an `=` is probably a little too much. I'll fix that in Bikeshed, and file a bug on HTML maybe.",
